cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this archive, please cite it as below."
title: "Reproduction archive for a doubly slotted annulus operator for magnetic equivalent circuits (Paper II)"
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/il1996/doubly-slotted-annulus-IM"
url: "https://github.com/il1996/doubly-slotted-annulus-IM/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-20"
abstract: >-
  Complete reproduction archive for the paper "A Doubly Slotted Annulus Operator
  for Magnetic Equivalent Circuits: Carter's Factor Is Low in the Thin-Gap,
  Wide-Opening Regime, on an 18.5 kW Cage Induction Machine". Contains the MATLAB
  chain for the 18.5 kW cage induction machine, the execution transcripts from
  which every published value originates, the ANSYS Maxwell 2D exports used as
  the reference, the manuscript source with its five figures, and delivery notes
  for each verification block.
